    "Summaries": {
        "eng": "The hero of this series, journalist Brian Thompson, takes us back to the great matches of the soccer world cup.\r\n\r\nThe story begins with the first World Cup in Uruguay in 1930 and ends with the 1994 World Cup in the United States, which also depicts Thompson's life from his youth to the present day. The spectacular play of players such as Franz Beckenbauer, Gard Müller, Eusebio and the greatest of them all, King Pele, is brilliantly reborn.",
        "jpn": ""
    },
